<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to auction 500 mln pesos T-bills July 15.</title>
<headline>Argentina to auction 500 mln pesos T-bills July 15.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina will auction 250 million pesos of 91-day Letes Treasury bills and $250 million of 182-day Letes on July 15, the Economy Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>The sale will take place in a Dutch-style auction. Settlement will be on June 18.</p>
<p>(( - Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
</text>
